s, représentation du signal, vidéo, partition). Les documents partagent les mêmes fichiers. iAnalyse fonctionne sur 2 plateformes : macOS et iPadOS. Les projets sont exactement identiques sur les 2 plateformes et sont compatibles avec les 2 systèmes. Les 2 versions contiennent exactement les mêmes fonctionnalités. Leur emplacement est toutefois différents à cause de la différence de fonctionnement de l'interaction.","s":"Introduction","u":"/ianalyse6/common/common-intro","h":"","p":1},{"i":4,"t":"Cette version de iAnalyse nécessite un système : Sur macOS : 11.0 ou supérieur Sur iPadOS : iOS 16.6 ou supérieur Sur iPadOS, il est recommander d'avoir suffisamment de mémoire pour stocker les médias ou de travailler sur un cloud. Pour une utilisation de iAnalyse sur des système macOS plus anciens, télécharger les versions précédentes : https://logiciels.pierrecouprie.fr.","s":"Configuration minimale","u":"/ianalyse6/common/common-intro","h":"#configuration-minimale","p":1}],"index":{"version":"2.3.9","fields":["t"],"fieldVectors":[["t/2",[0,0.29,1,0.227,2,0.227,3,0.603,4,0.603,5,0.29,6,0.603,7,0.603,8,0.603,9,0.356,10,0.603,11,0.603,12,0.603,13,0.603,14,1.011,15,0.603,16,1.104,17,0.865,18,0.603,19,0.865,20,0.603,21,0.603,22,0.603,23,0.603,24,0.603,25,0.159,26,0.865,27,0.603,28,1.011,29,0.603,30,0.865,31,0.603,32,0.865,33,0.603,34,0.603,35,0.603,36,0.603,37,0.603,38,0.603,39,0.603,40,0.603,41,0.865,42,0.603,43,0.603,44,0.603,45,0.603,46,0.603,47,0.603,48,0.603,49,0.329,50,0.603,51,0.865,52,0.865,53,0.227,54,1.104,55,0.865,56,0.159,57,0.159,58,0.865,59,0.865,60,0.603,61,0.603,62,0.603,63,0.159,64,0.159,65,0.603,66,0.603,67,0.603,68,0.603,69,0.603,70,0.603,71,0.603,72,0.603,73,0.603,74,0.603]],["t/4",[0,0.279,1,0.214,2,0.311,5,0.329,9,0.341,25,0.214,49,0.279,53,0.341,56,0.279,57,0.279,63,0.279,64,0.279,75,0.814,76,0.814,77,0.814,78,1.181,79,1.061,80,0.814,81,0.814,82,0.814,83,0.814,84,0.814,85,0.814,86,0.814,87,1.061,88,0.814,89,0.814,90,0.814,91,0.814,92,0.814,93,0.814,94,0